{
    "title": "My Porsche",
    "description": "The My Porsche app is the ideal companion for your Porsche experience. Call up the current vehicle status at any time and control Connect services remotely. The app is constantly being developed and additional features will be added in the next versions.\r\n\r\nThe My Porsche app offers you the following advantages*: \r\n\r\nVEHICLE STATUS \r\nYou can view the vehicle status at any time and display current vehicle information: \r\n\u2022\tFuel level/battery status and remaining range \r\n\u2022\tMileage \r\n\u2022\tTire pressure\r\n\u2022\tTrip data for your past journeys\r\n\u2022\tClosing status of the doors and windows \r\n\u2022\tRemaining charging time\r\n\r\nREMOTE CONTROL \r\nControl certain vehicle functions remotely:\r\n\u2022\tAir conditioning/pre-heater\r\n\u2022\tLocking and unlocking of the doors\r\n\u2022\tHorn and turn signals\r\n\u2022\tLocation alarm and speed alarm\r\n\u2022\tRemote Park Assist\r\n\r\nNAVIGATION\r\nPlan your next route:\r\n\u2022\tCall up the vehicle location\r\n\u2022\tNavigation to the vehicle\r\n\u2022\tSave destinations as favorites\r\n\u2022\tSend destinations to vehicle\r\n\u2022\tFind e-charging stations \r\n\u2022\tRoute planner including charging stops\r\n\r\nCHARGING\r\nManage and control vehicle charging: \r\n\u2022\tCharging timer\r\n\u2022\tDirect charging\r\n\u2022\tCharging profiles\r\n\u2022\tCharging planner\r\n\u2022\tCharging service: information about e-charging stations, activation of charging process, transaction history\r\n\r\nSERVICE & SAFETY\r\nReceive important information about workshop appointments, breakdown calls and operating instructions: \r\n\u2022\tService intervals and service appointment request\r\n\u2022\tVTS, theft notification, breakdown call\r\n\u2022\tDigital owners manual\r\n\r\nDISCOVER PORSCHE\r\nReceive exclusive information about Porsche:\r\n\u2022\tLatest information about the Porsche brand\r\n\u2022\tUpcoming events from Porsche\r\n\u2022\tExclusive content about your Porsche in production\r\n\r\n*In order to use all the features of the My Porsche app, you need a Porsche ID account. Simply register at login.porsche.de and add your Porsche if you own a vehicle. Please note that the range of features of the app may differ depending on the model, model year and country availability.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The My Porsche app is the ideal companion for your Porsche experience. Call up the current vehicle status at any time and control Connect services remotely. The app is constantly being developed and additional features will be added in the next versions.<br><br>The My Porsche app offers you the following advantages*: <br><br>VEHICLE STATUS <br>You can view the vehicle status at any time and display current vehicle information: <br>\u2022\tFuel level/battery status and remaining range <br>\u2022\tMileage <br>\u2022\tTire pressure<br>\u2022\tTrip data for your past journeys<br>\u2022\tClosing status of the doors and windows <br>\u2022\tRemaining charging time<br><br>REMOTE CONTROL <br>Control certain vehicle functions remotely:<br>\u2022\tAir conditioning/pre-heater<br>\u2022\tLocking and unlocking of the doors<br>\u2022\tHorn and turn signals<br>\u2022\tLocation alarm and speed alarm<br>\u2022\tRemote Park Assist<br><br>NAVIGATION<br>Plan your next route:<br>\u2022\tCall up the vehicle location<br>\u2022\tNavigation to the vehicle<br>\u2022\tSave destinations as favorites<br>\u2022\tSend destinations to vehicle<br>\u2022\tFind e-charging stations <br>\u2022\tRoute planner including charging stops<br><br>CHARGING<br>Manage and control vehicle charging: <br>\u2022\tCharging timer<br>\u2022\tDirect charging<br>\u2022\tCharging profiles<br>\u2022\tCharging planner<br>\u2022\tCharging service: information about e-charging stations, activation of charging process, transaction history<br><br>SERVICE &amp; SAFETY<br>Receive important information about workshop appointments, breakdown calls and operating instructions: <br>\u2022\tService intervals and service appointment request<br>\u2022\tVTS, theft notification, breakdown call<br>\u2022\tDigital owners manual<br><br>DISCOVER PORSCHE<br>Receive exclusive information about Porsche:<br>\u2022\tLatest information about the Porsche brand<br>\u2022\tUpcoming events from Porsche<br>\u2022\tExclusive content about your Porsche in production<br><br>*In order to use all the features of the My Porsche app, you need a Porsche ID account. Simply register at login.porsche.de and add your Porsche if you own a vehicle. Please note that the range of features of the app may differ depending on the model, model year and country availability.",
